  "body": "### What is the issue with the Streams Standard?\n\nThose are supposed to be called internally by API implementations, but if the resulting promises are not handled then it fires unhandled rejection handler. To prevent that we need to mark the promises as handled.\n\n(e.g. https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#writablestream-close)",
